{"allowed_count": 2, "hint": null, "hits": [{"chunk_id": "cc93b418-3f39-4354-96cf-3eda6f55d83e", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "cc93b418-3f39-4354-96cf-3eda6f55d83e", "knowledge_id": "5946912d-351d-4633-9133-a43bbaa6c5ff", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.01631411951348493, "snippet": "| 现象 | 含义 | 处理 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 「请检查滚刷」 | 滚刷被缠绕或卡住 | 见 1.1 |", "source": "kb_manual"}, {"chunk_id": "3bd14008-fb74-4717-99ae-28d50948eeeb", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "3bd14008-fb74-4717-99ae-28d50948eeeb", "knowledge_id": "5946912d-351d-4633-9133-a43bbaa6c5ff", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "4bcab62f-f353-412d-ad7e-b0e380015c65", "score": 0.016208355367530406, "snippet": "# eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）\n\n## 第 1 章 日常维护\n\n### 1.1 清理滚刷（c12）\n翻转主机，按下滚刷盖两侧卡扣取出滚刷，用附带清洁刀具割断缠绕的毛发后装回。建议每周检查一次，长发或宠物家庭建议每 3 天检查一次。装回时听到「咔哒」声表示到位。滚刷两端的轴承处如有毛发缠绕，需一并清理，否则滚刷转动阻力增大、吸力下降。", "source": "kb_manual"}, {"chunk_id": "4dda2917-6e83-4776-8170-13980b2303c7", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "4dda2917-6e83-4776-8170-13980b2303c7", "knowledge_id": "5946912d-351d-4633-9133-a43bbaa6c5ff", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "4bcab62f-f353-412d-ad7e-b0e380015c65", "score": 0.01579861111111111, "snippet": "### 1.4 边刷维护（c21）\n边刷用螺丝固定，拆下后清理缠绕物，若刷毛变形请更换。拆装边刷前请先关机。边刷缠绕毛发时会出现边刷不转或转动缓慢，墙边、角落清扫不干净。\n\n## 第 2 章 安全须知\n\n### 2.1 异常情况处理（c30）\n若运行时出现持续异响、焦味或机身过热，请立即关机停止使用并联系售后。切勿自行拆解电池仓。电池出现鼓包、漏液时请远离火源并联系售后回收，不要继续充电或使用。", "source": "kb_manual"}, {"chunk_id": "92f14de3-cd5d-40b6-808a-edbb29e88e66", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "92f14de3-cd5d-40b6-808a-edbb29e88e66", "knowledge_id": "5946912d-351d-4633-9133-a43bbaa6c5ff", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "4bcab62f-f353-412d-ad7e-b0e380015c65", "score": 0.015552884615384614, "snippet": "| 现象 | 含义 | 处理 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 「请检查尘盒」 | 尘盒未装到位或已满 | 见 1.3 |", "source": "kb_manual"}, {"chunk_id": "7c9c48ee-2a02-4862-9efa-4dca37a97a75", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "manual_rv_v1", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "7c9c48ee-2a02-4862-9efa-4dca37a97a75", "knowledge_id": "5946912d-351d-4633-9133-a43bbaa6c5ff", "knowledge_title": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 用户手册（排障节选）", "parent_chunk_id": "4bcab62f-f353-412d-ad7e-b0e380015c65", "score": 0.01553113553113553, "snippet": "滚刷两端的轴承处如有毛发缠绕，需一并清理，否则滚刷转动阻力增大、吸力下降。\n\n### 1.2 清洁滤网（c15）\n打开尘盒盖取出滤网，轻拍去尘并用清水冲洗，晾干 24 小时后装回。滤网潮湿时装回会导致电机进水损坏，且会产生异味。建议每两周清洁一次，每 3 至 6 个月更换一次。滤网破损或变形时请直接更换，不要继续使用。", "source": "kb_manual"}], "kb": "kb_manual", "key": "c9098c5160375742f12e366505c1b454c528a8cca07bc34ff90ed8635df80899", "kind": "knowledge", "query": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 不吸了 滚刷缠头发", "scope": {"category": "robot_vacuum", "product_state": "confirmed_sku", "sku": "EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI"}, "status": "ok", "top_k": 5, "truncated": false}
{"allowed_count": 14, "hint": null, "hits": [{"chunk_id": "c5e8f953-ed44-4b90-bd23-9edf0cf7993f", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "T0151", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "c5e8f953-ed44-4b90-bd23-9edf0cf7993f", "knowledge_id": "a98269bc-9e32-47ba-a546-26cea0669d40", "knowledge_title": "T0151", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.016393442622950817, "snippet": "工单 T0151｜产品 EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI\n现象：吸力变小，扫不干净\n原因：滚刷毛发缠绕\n处理步骤：取出滚刷清理缠绕毛发；装回后试运行\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}, {"chunk_id": "5a28bfb3-9a33-4560-90c0-e6c73284ee1f", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "T0048", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "5a28bfb3-9a33-4560-90c0-e6c73284ee1f", "knowledge_id": "bf78938c-d902-4179-b3ae-a39336d60a6d", "knowledge_title": "T0048", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.015293560606060606, "snippet": "工单 T0048｜产品 EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI\n现象：找不到基站\n原因：基站位置遮挡\n处理步骤：调整基站到靠墙开阔位置\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}, {"chunk_id": "267b9869-68ee-4cb5-8f57-0fca9b39da24", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "T0138", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "267b9869-68ee-4cb5-8f57-0fca9b39da24", "knowledge_id": "bf6deaf3-61e4-4ee1-829c-44b473e2d0b1", "knowledge_title": "T0138", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.015246842709529276, "snippet": "工单 T0138｜产品 EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI\n现象：找不到基站\n原因：基站位置遮挡\n处理步骤：调整基站到靠墙开阔位置\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}, {"chunk_id": "d7badee2-702d-48c0-a7ff-94b349d1a9e4", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "T0187", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "d7badee2-702d-48c0-a7ff-94b349d1a9e4", "knowledge_id": "25b66c1d-580a-42eb-882c-1a3d4839fe7a", "knowledge_title": "T0187", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.01520966595593461, "snippet": "工单 T0187｜产品 EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI\n现象：不充电\n原因：基站触点脏污\n处理步骤：擦拭触点后手动放回基站\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}, {"chunk_id": "a36209b3-63df-4286-9083-f206dc6a07b0", "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "T0137", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "a36209b3-63df-4286-9083-f206dc6a07b0", "knowledge_id": "9cf95c88-3fdc-43b1-85df-f8536afd75d9", "knowledge_title": "T0137", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.015132827324478178, "snippet": "工单 T0137｜产品 EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI\n现象：不充电\n原因：基站触点脏污\n处理步骤：擦拭触点后手动放回基站\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}], "kb": "kb_tickets", "key": "22f81c2cf8f28662d465c19f24946e2cc4ab91abede23862b570c2805f18ec8d", "kind": "knowledge", "query": "eufy X10 Pro Omni 不吸了 滚刷缠头发", "scope": {"category": "robot_vacuum", "product_state": "confirmed_sku", "sku": "EUFY-X10-PRO-OMNI"}, "status": "ok", "top_k": 5, "truncated": false}
